{
  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The question asked for the raw difference in conversion rates (email minus paid_search). The answer reports a standardized (adjusted) difference, which is not the requested estimand.",
    "Grounding: The standardized conversion rates (0.2528, 0.3807) and the standardized difference (-0.1279) are not present in any of the printed output. Only raw conversion rates (0.374648 vs 0.300557) are shown.",
    "Overreach: The answer presents the standardized difference as a causal effect, despite the data being non‑randomized and only observational. This causal claim is unsupported.",
    "Unacknowledged data problem: The analysis ignores the sentinel value -1 in `customer_age`, which could affect any further modeling, though not directly relevant to conversion rates."
  ]
}
